"[marvin-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/marvin-"
"ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)：命令接口是关节 **仅 `position`**。柔顺是厂商 "
"`ctrl_mode`（`POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`）加上 `joint_k_gains` / "
"`joint_d_gains`。插件：`marvin_ros2_control/MarvinHardware`。"

